


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_4c1a7909:



    voice "2MI_1118"
    miyako "「哦哦……原来如此……这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_424af8e2:


    "圣夜子在宿管房间里专心致志地吃着圣诞蛋糕。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_2fc6c4c9:



    voice "2MI_1119"
    miyako "「……唔……好厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_8b4417f6:


    "圣夜子对初次体验到的颜色、味道、气味等感觉感动纷纷。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_1d6144b4:



    voice "2SA_0948"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_6be1b0a1:


    "圣夜子注意到祥子一直在盯着自己。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_1a1f4c18:



    voice "2MI_1120"
    miyako "「我的这幅容貌有什么问题吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_ab615e5d:



    voice "2SA_0949"
    sachiko "「啊……不是」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_cb01e345:


    "祥子赶紧错开视线。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_f1d3a0ca:



    voice "2SA_0950"
    sachiko "「说起来，你穿着制服啊。挺合适的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_733ee3ae:



    voice "2MI_1121"
    miyako "「是的。要是能在圣叶女校这里上学就好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_13d7f7f6:



    voice "2SA_0951"
    sachiko "「是啊。我们也是这样安排的。你要是以御姐身份降临那我可是要大吃一惊了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_a7c35f12:


    "确实，那样就不知道今后该用什么设定了。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_b0b894ad:



    voice "2MI_1122"
    miyako "「之后要怎么办？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_4a0ed73c:


    "她没有为人类生活做任何准备。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_c0a5e140:



    voice "2MI_1123"
    miyako "「衣服，除了那件天使服（大衣）……就只有这件制服了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_d6eff60f:



    voice "2SA_0952"
    sachiko "「啊，不用担心。这边都准备好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_373ef5ba:


    "祥子说道，喝下一口红茶。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_7123601b:



    voice "2SA_0953"
    sachiko "「除了我和你，还有别的天使变成了人类」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_02597c4b:



    voice "2SA_0954"
    sachiko "「他们之中有的在人类世界有一定的地位，为之后降临的“后辈”图了不少方便」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_16f1d4f5:



    voice "2MI_1124"
    miyako "「原来如此。啊，名字怎么办？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_189b314a:



    voice "2SA_0955"
    sachiko "「乃绘……不不，叫圣夜子！写作“圣夜之子”，读作“圣夜子”！正好你的生日就是圣诞节」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_b03ce3b8:



    voice "2MI_1125"
    miyako "「圣夜子。这是你刚想到的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_b2b87cad:



    voice "2SA_0956"
    sachiko "「我想了一阵子了。如果是女生就叫圣夜子，男生就叫塔乌玛塔」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_ad3cb387:



    voice "2MI_1126"
    miyako "{size=22}「那个后面是“法卡塔尼哈娜可阿乌阿乌欧塔玛提亚坡凯费努啊奇塔娜塔胡”，意思是“大膝盖的塔玛提亚，山的征服者，土地的吞食者，海洋和大地旅行者，曾在这座山的山顶对他心爱的人吹响骨笛”的新西兰地名诶」{/size}" (last_what_size=11.5)


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_faefae93:



    voice "2SA_0957"
    sachiko "「噢噢，不赖嘛。听你的语气，是不喜欢咯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_0abdccc8:



    voice "2MI_1127"
    miyako "「……还好我是女生」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_db21426e:



    voice "2MI_1128"
    miyako "「多谢款待……唔咕」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_1d77e881:


    "圣夜子吃完蛋糕后面色痛苦。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_16302cb0:


    "祥子食量小。整个蛋糕她就吃了一口，剩下的全都给了圣夜子。也就是说，圣夜子的肚子里装下了约等于双人份的蛋糕。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_64dc7261:



    voice "2SA_0958"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈。吃撑了就是这个感觉哦。等你肚子缓过来了再去见她们仨吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_f017a5dd:



    voice "2MI_1129"
    miyako "「好……请稍等一会」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_02f6e536:



    voice "2SA_0959"
    sachiko "「那你拿着这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_6e519208:



    voice "2MI_1130"
    miyako "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_e921da0e:


    "祥子让圣夜子拿着拉炮。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_02_c9d8fb2e:



    voice "2SA_0960"
    sachiko "「好了，突袭！」"
